# hair/adult/tousled_tuft: Tousled's cowlick tip: it stretches as the head drops, flattens as it rises (tuft keys)
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY); A3's pixels are the reference (docs/ref/style_a3). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role hair tousled
layer hairFront
anchor head
keys tuft
z 1

view D key down origin -10 1
|a

view D key fierce origin -13 -9
|s

view D key up origin -9 0
|--
|.a

view U key down origin -6 1
|a

view U key up origin -5 0
|--
|.a
